## BAB 5: PIPELINE KALKULASI SUDUT

### 5.1 Diagram Alur Lengkap

```
INPUT: Waktu (UTC) + Lokasi (φ, λ, elev)
│
├── STEP 1: Hitung JD & LST
│     JD   = julday(Y, M, D, H_decimal_utc)
│     GMST = sidtime(JD)                   [jam]
│     LST  = (GMST × 15 + λ) mod 360      [derajat]
│
├── STEP 2: Set toposentrik
│     swe.set_topo(λ, φ, elev)
│
├── STEP 3: Hitung posisi tiap entitas
│     │
│     ├── TZ/CZ → v = [0, 0, +1]  (statis/konstan)
│     ├── TN/CN → v = [0, 0, -1]  (statis/konstan)
│     │
│     ├── Planet → calc_ut(JD, id, 32768)
│     │              → ekliptika (λ, β)
│     │              → eclToEq(λ, β)   → (RA, Dec)
│     │              → eqToHz(RA, Dec, LST, φ)  → (Az, Alt)
│     │              → toVec(Az, Alt)  → [x, y, z]
│     │
│     └── Sirius → fixstar2_ut('Sirius', JD, 0)
│                    → ekliptika (λ, β)
│                    → eclToEq → eqToHz → toVec
│
├── STEP 4: Hitung θ semua pasangan
│     Untuk (i,j) dimana i ≠ j:
│       θ_ij = gcSep(v_i, v_j)
│            = arccos(clamp(v_i · v_j, -1, +1)) × (180/π)
│
├── STEP 5: Filter zona
│     j > i : Zenith Zone → cek isZenithSide(i) & isZenithSide(j)
│     j < i : Nadir Zone  → cek isNadirSide(i) & isNadirSide(j)
│
├── STEP 6: Match aspek
│     Untuk setiap pasangan aktif:
│       → matchAspect(θ_ij, mode_orb)
│       → aspek dengan orb terkecil (jika ada)
│
└── STEP 7: Deteksi anomali
      → hitungAnomalyKubah(zenith_pairs, nadir_pairs)
```

### 5.2 Konversi Koordinat

```
A. EKLIPTIKA → EKUATORIAL:

   Input  : λ (longitude ekliptika, °), β (latitude ekliptika, °)
   Output : RA (radian), Dec (radian)

   ε = 23.439291° = 0.40905 rad  (obliquitas J2000)

   sin(Dec) = sin(β) × cos(ε) + cos(β) × sin(ε) × sin(λ)
   Dec = arcsin(clamp(sin(Dec), -1, +1))

   RA = atan2(
     sin(λ) × cos(ε) - tan(β) × sin(ε),
     cos(λ)
   )
   if RA < 0: RA += 2π


B. EKUATORIAL → HORIZONTAL:

   Input  : RA (rad), Dec (rad), LST (rad), φ (rad)
   Output : Az (radian, 0=Utara CW), Alt (radian)

   HA = LST - RA   (Hour Angle)

   sin(Alt) = sin(φ) × sin(Dec) + cos(φ) × cos(Dec) × cos(HA)
   Alt = arcsin(clamp(sin(Alt), -1, +1))

   Az = atan2(-sin(HA), tan(Dec) × cos(φ) - sin(φ) × cos(HA))
   if Az < 0: Az += 2π


C. HORIZONTAL → VEKTOR 3D:

   Input  : Az (radian), Alt (radian)
   Output : v = [x, y, z]

   Sumbu: +X = Utara, +Y = Timur, +Z = Zenith

   x = cos(Alt) × cos(Az)
   y = cos(Alt) × sin(Az)
   z = sin(Alt)

   Bukti unit: x² + y² + z² = cos²(Alt) + sin²(Alt) = 1 ✓
```

### 5.3 Great-Circle Separation

```
FORMULA INTI:

   Input  : v₁ = [x₁, y₁, z₁]  (unit vector entitas A)
            v₂ = [x₂, y₂, z₂]  (unit vector entitas B)
   Output : θ dalam derajat

   D     = x₁×x₂ + y₁×y₂ + z₁×z₂   (dot product)
   D_c   = max(-1, min(+1, D))        (clamp anti-NaN)
   θ     = arccos(D_c) × (180/π)

   Rentang: θ ∈ [0°, 180°]
   Simetri: θ(A,B) = θ(B,A)  (dot product komutatif)


KASUS KHUSUS PERSONA:

   θ(TZ, X) = arccos([0,0,1] · [x,y,z])
             = arccos(z)
             = arccos(sin(Alt_X))
             = 90° - Alt_X

   θ(TN, X) = arccos([0,0,-1] · [x,y,z])
             = arccos(-z)
             = arccos(-sin(Alt_X))
             = 90° + Alt_X
```

