## BAB 9: VALIDASI & TEST CASES

### 9.1 Test Cases Deterministik

```
TEST 1: Konjungsi TZ-Planet (Alt = +90°)

  Setup: Planet X tepat di Zenith, Alt = 90°
  v_TZ = [0, 0, 1]
  v_X  = [cos90°·cos(Az), cos90°·sin(Az), sin90°] = [0, 0, 1]
  
  D = 0·0 + 0·0 + 1·1 = 1.0
  θ = arccos(1.0) = 0° → Konjungsi ✓


TEST 2: Kuadrat TZ-Planet (Alt = 0°, di Horizon)

  v_TZ = [0, 0, 1]
  v_X  = [cos0°·cos90°, cos0°·sin90°, sin0°] = [0, 1, 0]
         (Az=90° sebagai contoh)
  
  D = 0·0 + 0·1 + 1·0 = 0
  θ = arccos(0) = 90° → Kuadrat ✓


TEST 3: Trigon TZ-Planet (Alt = -30°)

  a = -30° = -0.5236 rad
  v_TZ = [0, 0, 1]
  
  D = sin(-30°) = -0.5
  θ = arccos(-0.5) = 120° → Trigon ✓


TEST 4: Oposisi TZ-TN (selalu)

  v_TZ = [0, 0, +1]
  v_TN = [0, 0, -1]
  
  D = 0·0 + 0·0 + (+1)·(-1) = -1
  θ = arccos(-1) = 180° → Oposisi ✓


TEST 5: Konjungsi TZ-CZ (selalu)

  v_TZ = [0, 0, +1]
  v_CZ = [0, 0, +1]
  
  D = 1
  θ = 0° → Konjungsi ✓


TEST 6: Sekstil TZ-Planet (Alt = +30°)

  θ = 90° - 30° = 60° → Sekstil ✓
  Verifikasi:
    v_TZ = [0,0,1], v_X = [cos30°·cos(Az), cos30°·sin(Az), sin30°]
    D = sin(30°) = 0.5
    θ = arccos(0.5) = 60° ✓


TEST 7: Anomali Aspek — Zenith (N=3)

  Setup: 3 aspek aktif di Zenith Zone, N_Aspek=3
  count_zen = 3 ≥ N_Aspek = 3 → ANOMALI AKTIF ✓


TEST 8: Anomali Identik — Nadir (N=2)

  Setup:
    θ(A,B) = 60.05°
    θ(C,D) = 60.08°
    θ(E,F) = 60.03°

  Setelah bucketing (±0.1°):
    group[60.0°] = [(A,B), (C,D), (E,F)] → 3 pasangan

  N_Identik = 2, total_identical = 3 ≥ 2 → ANOMALI AKTIF ✓


TEST 9: ORB Custom — Konflik Terdeteksi

  Setup: Sekstil ORB=7°, Kuintil ORB=7°
  Gap = |72° - 60°| = 12°
  Total ORB = 7° + 7° = 14°
  12° < 14° → KONFLIK TERDETEKSI → Peringatan UI ✓


TEST 10: Matching Nearest-ORB

  θ = 60.4°
  Sekstil (60°): deviation = 0.4°, ORB_seks = 1.0° → KANDIDAT
  Kuintil (72°): deviation = 11.6° > ORB_kuin → bukan kandidat
  
  HASIL: Sekstil, orb 0.4° ✓
```

